msgid "游戏语言"
msgstr "Game Language"

msgid "简体中文"
msgstr "Simplified Chinese"

msgid "繁体中文"
msgstr "Traditional Chinese"

msgid "国际服请设置为繁体中文"
msgstr "Set this to Traditional Chinese for the international server."

msgid ""
"1. 自动战斗依赖按键识别，请在游戏设置中打开快捷键显示，提升出牌准确率。\n"
"2. 国际服玩家请将本模式配置中的\"游戏语言\"设置为繁体中文。"
msgstr ""
"1. Auto battle relies on shortcut recognition. Enable shortcut display in the game settings for better accuracy.\n"
"2. International server players should set Game Language to Traditional Chinese in this mode."

msgid ""
"1. 请主动打开游戏内自动战斗和自动剧情功能。\n"
"2. 国际服玩家请将本模式配置中的\"游戏语言\"设置为繁体中文。"
msgstr ""
"1. Enable auto battle and auto story in the game.\n"
"2. International server players should set Game Language to Traditional Chinese in this mode."

msgid "点击后页面一响应就继续，不再固定等待；关闭后完全恢复原版逻辑"
msgstr "Continue as soon as the page responds to a click instead of waiting a fixed time. When off, the original logic is restored."

msgid "鼠标移到目标后等待多久再点击，原版固定 0.5 秒"
msgstr "How long to hover over the target before clicking when 加速模式 is on (originally a fixed 0.5 s)."

msgid "非战斗时两次识别的最短间隔，原版 1 秒；战斗中保持 1 秒"
msgstr "Minimum interval between recognitions outside battle when 加速模式 is on (originally 1 s; stays 1 s in battle)."

msgid "关闭后商店不再点击「免费」刷新，没货就离开；开启后恢复原版刷新"
msgstr "When off, the shop's free refresh is not used and the shop is left when nothing is worth buying. When on, the original refresh behavior is restored."

msgid "保命牌（加护盾、回血）：牌名带「盾」「格挡」「壁」「治」「疗」「恢复」等字的会自动认出，这里只需补充认不出的牌；预计这回合会被打死时先出这些牌"
msgstr "Survival cards (shield or heal): cards whose names contain words like 盾, 格挡, 壁, 治, 疗 or 恢复 are recognized automatically, so only list the ones that are missed; they are played first when this turn's incoming damage would be lethal."

msgid "攻击牌拖到目标上时读击杀预览，记下这张牌本场的伤害；估计能一张牌打死别的敌人时，先悬停确认再补刀；关闭时直接打目标"
msgstr "Read the kill preview when an attack card is dragged onto its target and remember the card's damage for this battle; when a card looks able to kill another enemy, hover over it to confirm and finish it off first. When off, attack the target directly."

msgid "前期收集数据用：遇到没见过的意图图标时点开怪物信息面板读出意图并记下图标，会变慢；图标收集够后关闭"
msgstr "For early data collection: when an unknown intent icon is seen, open the enemy info panel to read the intent and save the icon. Slower; turn off once enough icons are collected."

msgid "把每次出牌看到了什么、为什么这样出写进 battle_logs 目录，便于统计和排查"
msgstr "Write what was seen and why each card was played to the battle_logs folder, for statistics and troubleshooting."

msgid "出现异常（AP不足、出不掉牌、识别失败、战斗失败等）时截图，同一种异常每场战斗最多 1 张"
msgstr "Take a screenshot on anomalies (insufficient AP, a card that cannot be played, recognition failures, lost battles, etc.), at most one per kind per battle."

msgid "battle_logs 里的记录和截图保留多少天"
msgstr "How many days to keep records and screenshots in battle_logs."

msgid "battle_logs 总大小超过这个值时从最旧的文件删起"
msgstr "When battle_logs grows beyond this size, the oldest files are deleted first."

msgid "要刷存档的主战员名字。好装备、冥想、移除卡牌都优先给这个人，结算时存进存档的也是这个人"
msgstr "Name of the member whose archive you are farming. Good equipment, meditation and card removal go to this member first, and this member's data is what gets saved."

msgid "打完第一层就结束本轮（到第一层 boss 前直接撤退），本轮记成功"
msgstr "End the run after the first layer (retreat right before the first-layer boss) and count it as a success."

msgid "跑完这么多轮后自动停止，0 为一直跑"
msgstr "Stop automatically after this many runs; 0 runs forever."

msgid "到这一层的 boss 前停下来，留给你手动打"
msgstr "Pause before the boss of this layer so you can fight it manually."

msgid "把每个决定（出牌、装备、选卡、路线等）看到了什么、为什么这样做写进 battle_logs 目录，便于统计和排查"
msgstr "Write what was seen and why each decision was made (cards, equipment, card picks, routes, etc.) to the battle_logs folder for statistics and troubleshooting."

msgid "零式系统法典卡片、获得法典选项上「存档资料储存上限」低于这个值就重新合成；几个选项都达标时选上限最低的。0 为不限制"
msgstr "Re-synthesize when the archive storage limit on the Zero System codex card or Obtain Codex options is below this value; when several options qualify, take the lowest. 0 means no limit."

msgid "结算时存档价值不高于这个值的存档会被删除，0 为全部保留"
msgstr "At settlement, archives worth no more than this value are deleted; 0 keeps all."

msgid "结算时用验证卡领取卡厄思奖励；验证卡用完后自动关闭"
msgstr "Claim Chaos rewards with verification cards at settlement; turns itself off when cards run out."

msgid "填写目标卡牌名称后反复刷新初始卡牌；不能与“刷空档”同时使用。"
msgstr "Keep rerolling the starting cards until this card appears; cannot be used together with empty-deck farming."

msgid "初始任务必须包含“移除2张”，否则重新开始；不能与“刷初始卡牌”同时使用。"
msgstr "Restart unless the starting task contains \"remove 2 cards\"; cannot be used together with starting-card farming."

msgid "默认刷闪光优先级第一张，可刷神闪，第一层没刷出自动逃脱"
msgstr "Farm the first entry of the flash priority (divine flashes included); escape if it does not appear on the first layer."

msgid "选路线时节点类型的优先顺序，越靠前越优先"
msgstr "Node types to prefer when choosing a route, highest first."

msgid "事件选项按列表顺序，选第一个描述里包含该文字的选项"
msgstr "For event options, pick the first option whose description contains an entry, in list order."

msgid "描述里包含这些文字的事件选项不选（全部被拉黑时照常选）"
msgstr "Never pick event options whose description contains these words (unless every option is blocked)."

msgid "路过商店时进去买东西（删牌、装备等）"
msgstr "Enter shops along the way to buy things (card removal, equipment, etc.)."

msgid "主战员精神崩溃时去创伤中心治疗"
msgstr "Treat members with a mental breakdown at the Trauma Center."

msgid "治疗崩溃时用信用点，关闭时优先用旅行券"
msgstr "Pay for breakdown treatment with credits; when off, use travel vouchers first."

msgid "卡牌奖励页按列表顺序选第一张包含该文字的牌"
msgstr "On card reward pages, pick the first card containing an entry, in list order."

msgid "删牌时按列表顺序选第一张包含该文字的牌"
msgstr "When removing cards, pick the first card containing an entry, in list order."

msgid "删牌时先删基础牌，再按「移除卡牌列表」"
msgstr "Remove basic cards first, then follow the removal list."

msgid "复制卡牌时按列表顺序选第一张包含该文字的牌"
msgstr "When copying cards, pick the first card containing an entry, in list order."

msgid "灵光一闪时选哪张牌，按列表顺序选第一张包含该文字的牌"
msgstr "Which card to flash, picking the first card containing an entry, in list order."

msgid "卡牌名称和描述无需完整填写，输入几个关键字即可，但顺序须与游戏原文一致。"
msgstr "Card names and descriptions do not need to be complete; a few keywords are enough, but they must appear in the same order as the game text."

msgid "休息区冥想时选哪些牌，每张本局冥想一次"
msgstr "Cards to meditate on at rest sites; each once per run."

msgid "信用点不少于这个数时，休息区才冥想"
msgstr "Only meditate at rest sites when credits are at least this amount."

msgid "面具获得卡牌页选描述里包含这段文字的牌，没有就刷新或跳过；留空直接跳过"
msgstr "On the mask card page, pick the card whose description contains this text, otherwise refresh or skip; leave empty to skip."

msgid "面具卡牌刻印页要的刻印描述，不是就刷新或跳过"
msgstr "Wanted engraving description on the mask card engraving page; refresh or skip otherwise."

msgid "「选择刻印的记忆」页按列表顺序选第一张包含该关键词的记忆卡（牌名或描述，如「贪婪」「全体攻击」），三张都不含时先用卡下方的「重新搜索」刷新"
msgstr "On the memory engraving page, pick the first memory card containing an entry (name or description); if none match, refresh with Search Again first."

msgid "记忆卡牌优先级都没匹配上时选第几张"
msgstr "Which memory card to pick when nothing in the memory priority matches."

msgid "记忆雕琢完成后的「记忆加工」页按列表顺序选第一张描述包含该关键词的卡（如「攻击力」「伤害量」），几张都包含时选百分比大的；都不包含时选百分比最大的"
msgstr "On the Memory Processing page after carving, pick the first card whose description contains an entry (e.g. ATK, damage); if several match, take the higher percentage; if none match, take the highest percentage."

msgid "攻击力（1 号位）装备的优先顺序，写在这里的装备优先给刷存档主战员，独特装备的名额也只留给这里写的"
msgstr "Priority of attack (slot 1) equipment. Listed items go to the archive member first, and that member's single unique slot is reserved for them."

msgid "防御力（2 号位）装备的优先顺序，写在这里的装备优先给刷存档主战员，独特装备的名额也只留给这里写的"
msgstr "Priority of defense (slot 2) equipment. Listed items go to the archive member first, and that member's single unique slot is reserved for them."

msgid "生命值（3 号位）装备的优先顺序，写在这里的装备优先给刷存档主战员，独特装备的名额也只留给这里写的"
msgstr "Priority of HP (slot 3) equipment. Listed items go to the archive member first, and that member's single unique slot is reserved for them."

msgid "出现异常（识别失败、画面卡住、未识别页面等）时截图，同一种异常每场战斗最多 1 张；卡住、循环、输掉战斗等问题改存现场包（前后各 30 秒的画面和识别结果，在 battle_logs/现场）"
msgstr "Take a screenshot on anomalies (recognition failures, frozen screen, unknown pages, etc.), at most one per kind per battle; stuck screens, loops, lost battles and similar problems save a scene package instead (30 seconds of frames and recognition results before and after, in battle_logs/现场)."

msgid "标记现场"
msgstr "Mark Scene"

msgid "把前 30 秒和后 30 秒的画面、识别结果和动作存成现场包，供事后排查"
msgstr "Save the last 30 seconds and the next 30 seconds (frames, recognition results and actions) as a scene package for later troubleshooting"

msgid "主战员配置页选出战主战员时，按列表顺序挑"
msgstr "Members to send out on the member setup page, in list order."

msgid "开局「主战员选择」页按列表顺序挑队友；都没有时先刷新一次，再优先选保护、治疗角色"
msgstr "Teammates to pick on the member selection page, in list order; if none appear, refresh once, then prefer protectors and healers."

msgid "「主战员选择」页不选这些人"
msgstr "Never pick these members on the member selection page."

msgid "结算时领取卡厄思战利品，关闭时放弃"
msgstr "Claim the Chaos loot at settlement; when off, give it up."

msgid "休息区血量高于上限的这个百分比时闪光，否则休息"
msgstr "At rest sites, flash when HP is above this percentage of max, otherwise rest."

msgid "「获得卡牌」页和抽牌事件按列表顺序选第一张包含该文字的牌"
msgstr "On Obtain Card pages and draw events, pick the first card containing an entry, in list order."

msgid "休息区闪光时选哪张牌，填牌名；本局这些牌都闪过（选牌页里不再出现）后，休息区改为休息"
msgstr "Cards to flash at rest sites. Once all of them have been flashed this run (no longer offered), rest instead."

msgid "闪光出来的 3 个版本选哪个：「牌名:关键词」只对这张牌生效，不带牌名的对所有牌生效；关键词写描述里的几个字，顺序与原文一致。都没命中时保留原类型、选数值最大的"
msgstr "Which of the 3 flash versions to take. \"Card:keywords\" applies to that card only, plain keywords apply to all; keywords are a few characters from the description in original order. If nothing matches, keep the original type and take the largest value."

msgid "战斗中先出这些牌（按列表顺序），排在 0 费、强化、攻击牌之前；3 个字以上的牌名读错一个字也能认出"
msgstr "Play these cards first in battle (list order), ahead of 0-cost, enhance and attack cards; names of 3+ characters still match with one misread character."

msgid "保命牌（加护盾、回血）：牌名带「盾」「格挡」「壁」「治」「疗」「恢复」等字的会自动认出，这里只需补充认不出的牌；预计这回合会被打死、或挨打后血量低于「防御血量线」时先出这些牌"
msgstr "Survival cards (shields, heals). Names containing shield/block/wall/heal words are recognized automatically; list only the ones that are missed. Played first when this turn could be lethal or HP would drop below the defense HP line."

msgid "预计敌人这一轮打完后我方血量低于上限的百分之几，就先出保命牌；0 为只在会被打死时才出"
msgstr "Play survival cards first when HP after the enemies' attacks is expected to drop below this percentage of max; 0 means only when it would be lethal."
